[80.046629, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mnpx -y nosedive@2026.8.31 preflight\r\nInstalled nosedive pre-push hook: .git/nosedive-hooks/pre-push\r\n== bridge status ==\r\nnosedive-workspace: /tmp/nosedive-cast/BASE/workspace\r\nnosedive-compatibility-level: 2\r\nnosedive-bridge-freshness: HEAD 04f421c matches origin/main 04f421c\r\n\r\n== pilot identification ==\r\nnosedive-pilot-name: Dan Stace\r\nnosedive-pilot-email: dstace@gmail.com\r\n\r\n== feats and their dives ==\r\n\r\n## [Add A Hello Note](kb/01a05aa1-996b-706d-9172-334b46d28253.md)\r\n\r\n- kb/01a05aa1-a3e2-7cca-966f-4d1bcf8b4d81.md: Add a hello note to the bridge -- needs=diver logged just now\r\n\r\nIf any line above starts with `nose:`, alert the pilot before taking action.\r\nIf the pilot wants to work on something specific, start with `nosedive jump <doc-path>`.\r\nOtherwise, suggest they address something that has `needs`.\r\nIf nothing needs to be done right now, start a free dive with `nosedive record.dive --free`, then help the pilot choose a feat."]
