[86.880766, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mnpx -y nosedive@2026.8.31 jump kb/01a05aa1-a3e2-7cca-966f-4d1bcf8b4d81.md\r\nhydrated repo=01a05aa1-8a98-7439-b13b-919e40433733 path=workspace/__self\r\njump: BASE is pinned 4 commits behind main; re-pin with `npx -y nosedive@2026.8.31 record.dive --ref 01a05aa1-a3e2-7cca-966f-4d1bcf8b4d81 --repin`\r\njumped dive 01a05aa1-a3e2-7cca-966f-4d1bcf8b4d81: applied 1 artifact(s)\r\n\r\nRead the dive at kb/01a05aa1-a3e2-7cca-966f-4d1bcf8b4d81.md in full and get the gist of its links.\r\nRead the feat it serves at kb/01a05aa1-996b-706d-9172-334b46d28253.md\r\nThen follow the dive's ## Brief section.\r\nAny notes below were logged by prior divers; use for added context.\r\n\r\nCommit completed work in these repos, and nowhere else:\r\n- workspace/__self (kb name: BASE) -- work branch work/add-a-hello-note\r\n\r\nAs you progress, use `nosedive append-log.dive` to record what you did, and what you think is next.\r\nDo not edit the brief or change any scopes.\r\nWhen done, leave the work in place for the pilot to review. \r\nDo not run `nosedive land` unless you have been directly instructed to.\r\nScratch space for this dive: workspace/.scratch/01a05aa1-a3e2-7cca-966f-4d1bcf8b4d81/ Write temp files there, never /tmp. It is local only; pack will not capture it.\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
